  "instructions": [
    "Cook the noodles according to package instructions until they are al-dente.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion to the skillet and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the skillet and cook for an additional minute.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the sumac, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the spice mixture to the skillet and cook for one minute.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked noodles, skillet mixture, and tahini sauce.",
    "Stir until the noodles are well coated with the sauce and spices.",
    "Divide the noodle mixture among four shawarma wraps.",
    "Top each shawarma with chopped parsley and a squeeze of lemon juice."
